## Why This Is Asked
Understanding real-world tenant isolation, cryptographic key management, and incident response in a sandboxed multi-tenant pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation, per-tenant keys, envelope encryption, runtime attestation, SBOM, tamper-evident logs.
- Sandboxed rules using WASM with restricted APIs and strict surface area.

## Code Example
